    "kind": "unit",
    "count": 1,
    "pages": [
      "/about/"
    ]
  },
  "d76d909c257a": {
    "en": "This starter began as an internal template we used every time a new client needed a fresh website. After rebuilding the same header, footer, and design-token system for the fifth time, we packaged everything into Astro Fleet — a monorepo starter that ships with shared components, typed design tokens, and a Turborepo build pipeline ready to go.",
    "kind": "unit",
    "count": 1,
    "pages": [
      "/about/"
    ]
  },
  "cbc1149258cb": {
    "en": "What We Believe",
    "kind": "unit",
    "count": 1,
    "pages": [
      "/about/"
    ]
  },
  "0351c6797e4e": {
    "en": "Good infrastructure should be invisible. Your team should spend time crafting content and conversion flows, not wiring up CSS variables or debugging shared dependency versions. Astro Fleet handles the plumbing so you can focus on what matters.",
